flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser or PWA] --> Gateway[RENTipid sign-in gateway]
  Gateway --> Email[Email and password]
  Gateway --> Phone[WhatsApp OTP]
  Gateway --> OAuth[Google / Facebook / Apple]
  Email --> Auth[Unified authentication services]
  Phone --> Auth
  OAuth --> NextAuth[NextAuth provider callbacks]
  NextAuth --> Auth
  Auth --> Identity[(AuthProviderIdentity / PhoneIdentity / EmailCredential)]
  Identity --> User[(Permanent User)]
  User --> Session[JWT plus UserSession registry]
  Session --> RBAC[RENTipid RBAC and account status checks]
  RBAC --> Marketplace[Marketplace application]
